      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战翌日。我们乘新干线返回学园，\n在惯常的训练员室里开会。\n议题是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1951fafe3ce8a0e7fd3e2cc380714e900aaab351da6e5a2a695d5b11c0705a96",
