    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9375f7c2f19de9736202d496",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是，新年刚过不久时的事。\n在中山赛马场――",
      "source_fingerprint": "620eebbfc5dc0034bbd311102992f32001fd130976a29d1b4cc0866c93bcd653",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
