    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ffd930413dfa9e00f1c8477",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，她还置身于一众志在三冠的新锐之中，\n堂堂取胜。……实在令人惊叹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5246180d35696ae9bf862ca65ef4d3becfa1fd852fe0e5a8c76ef8e518c84bea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
